          </h3>
        </div>
        <div className="flex items-center gap-3 text-[11px] text-void-400 font-mono">
          <span className="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span className="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded bg-void-800 border border-void-700"></span> Düşük
          </span>
